    <briefdescription>
<para>Gauss-Gegenbauer integration. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class performs a 1-dimensional Gauss-Gegenbauer integration. <formula id="196">\[ \int_{-1}^{1} f(x) \mathrm{d}x \]</formula> The weighting function is <formula id="202">\[ w(x)=(1-x^2)^{\lambda-1/2} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
